c_ts_s_tz timestamp(6) with time zone
c_ts_ms timestamp(6) without time zone
c_ts_ms_tz timestamp(6) with time zone
c_ts_us timestamp(6) without time zone
c_ts_us_tz timestamp(6) with time zone
c_ts_ns timestamp(6) without time zone
c_ts_ns_tz timestamp(6) with time zone
